WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.785 --> 00:00:16.606
glared at the two scared priests.

2
00:00:18.227 --> 00:00:19.347
robe is gone?"

3
00:00:19.687 --> 00:00:20.267
he cried.

4
00:00:20.287 --> 00:00:22.128
"Where did it go?"

5
00:00:23.349 --> 00:00:24.049
"We don't know!"

6
00:00:24.349 --> 00:00:25.190
said one priest.

7
00:00:25.210 --> 00:00:28.071
"We tried to find it," added the other.

8
00:00:28.091 --> 00:00:30.952
"The robe was in a room that didn't get burned at all.

9
00:00:31.980 --> 00:00:33.100
But it's not there anymore."

10
00:00:34.401 --> 00:00:38.362
His iron bar instantly appeared from inside his ear.

11
00:00:40.243 --> 00:00:41.263
commanded Wukong.

12
00:00:42.543 --> 00:00:45.104
The monkey swung it toward the two priests.

13
00:00:46.084 --> 00:00:49.325
But before the bar hit them, it dropped from the monkey's hands.

14
00:00:51.786 --> 00:00:53.947
fell to the ground, crying in pain.

15
00:00:53.967 --> 00:00:55.407
"It hurts!

16
00:00:55.587 --> 00:00:56.388
It hurts!"

17
00:00:56.728 --> 00:00:58.504
he cried.

18
00:00:58.584 --> 00:01:01.785
The Tang Monk was quietly reciting the Tight Headband spell.

19
00:01:02.745 --> 00:01:05.506
Wukong rolled around, kicking and screaming.

20
00:01:06.366 --> 00:01:08.307
The two priests jumped up and backed away.

21
00:01:08.327 --> 00:01:10.668
"Stop reciting the spell!"

22
00:01:10.888 --> 00:01:12.308
Wukong yelled at the Tang Monk.

23
00:01:13.869 --> 00:01:14.549
begging you!

24
00:01:14.569 --> 00:01:16.269
I won't hurt the priests!"

25
00:01:17.430 --> 00:01:20.250
The Tang Monk stopped, and Wukong stood up.

26
00:01:23.791 --> 00:01:28.593
The monkey took a deep breath and put the iron bar back in his ear.

27
00:01:29.774 --> 00:01:31.915
The Tang Monk looked at the two priests.

28
00:01:32.915 --> 00:01:34.436
"You really don't know where the robe is?"

29
00:01:34.456 --> 00:01:37.417
"No," said one priest.

30
00:01:38.718 --> 00:01:40.359
head priest ran away last night.

31
00:01:40.979 --> 00:01:41.980
He didn't have it with him."

32
00:01:43.640 --> 00:01:44.561
tapped his chin.

33
00:01:44.581 --> 00:01:47.962
"A monster or demon might have stolen it.

34
00:01:49.283 --> 00:01:51.284
Are there any monsters or demons living near here?"

35
00:01:52.808 --> 00:01:56.511
"Some people believe there's a monster in the mountains nearby," said the other priest.

36
00:01:56.531 --> 00:01:59.113
"They say it's a black bear spirit."

37
00:02:00.814 --> 00:02:03.236
go see if the bear took the robe," said Wukong.

38
00:02:03.256 --> 00:02:04.837
"I'll be back soon."

39
00:02:06.578 --> 00:02:09.580
Wukong leaped into the air and landed up in the mountains.

40
00:02:14.864 --> 00:02:16.845
He walked for a bit and then heard voices.

41
00:02:19.027 --> 00:02:22.685
Peeking over a boulder, he saw a group of spirits talking.

42
00:02:23.906 --> 00:02:25.926
One was a large black bear.

43
00:02:28.548 --> 00:02:29.388
The bear laughed.

44
00:02:29.408 --> 00:02:32.269
"The monastery was on fire last night.

45
00:02:33.570 --> 00:02:37.311
I went down to check it out and found a wonderful Buddhist robe.

46
00:02:38.592 --> 00:02:40.413
think it's a Buddhist treasure.

47
00:02:41.813 --> 00:02:43.414
Anyway, I stole it.

48
00:02:44.594 --> 00:02:47.816
So tonight I'm throwing a feast to celebrate!"

49
00:02:50.172 --> 00:02:53.413
When Wukong heard the other spirits laugh, he was furious.

50
00:02:54.534 --> 00:02:57.595
He jumped over the boulder and landed in the middle of the group.

51
00:02:57.615 --> 00:03:00.796
"Give back the robe right now!"

52
00:03:01.016 --> 00:03:01.536
he cried.

53
00:03:02.736 --> 00:03:04.236
pulled out his iron bar.

54
00:03:04.257 --> 00:03:07.177
"Or I'll destroy all of you!"

55
00:03:08.358 --> 00:03:10.518
The spirits all fled in different directions.

56
00:03:12.999 --> 00:03:16.100
Wukong chased the bear until they reached a cave entrance.

57
00:03:17.876 --> 00:03:20.457
The bear ran inside and slammed the door shut.

58
00:03:25.159 --> 00:03:27.260
Wukong pounded on the cave's door.

59
00:03:27.280 --> 00:03:31.102
"Come out here right now or I'll smash this door down!"

60
00:03:32.422 --> 00:03:33.362
door flew open.

61
00:03:34.523 --> 00:03:35.623
The bear stepped out.

62
00:03:36.244 --> 00:03:38.885
He was holding a lance.

63
00:03:39.645 --> 00:03:42.306
"How dare you pound on my door and yell at me!"

64
00:03:42.566 --> 00:03:43.126
he cried.

65
00:03:43.146 --> 00:03:45.587
"You stole my master's robe!"

66
00:03:45.848 --> 00:03:46.568
said Wukong.

67
00:03:48.020 --> 00:03:50.362
can do whatever I want," said the bear.

68
00:03:50.382 --> 00:03:53.544
"I am the Black Wind King.

69
00:03:54.465 --> 00:03:57.487
I'm the most powerful monster in these mountains!"

70
00:03:57.507 --> 00:04:03.431
"I am Sun Wukong, king of the Fruit and Flower Mountain," said the monkey.

71
00:04:03.451 --> 00:04:07.073
"I caused lots of trouble in Heaven five hundred years ago.

72
00:04:08.094 --> 00:04:10.776
The Jade Emperor's entire army couldn't defeat me!"

73
00:04:12.717 --> 00:04:14.538
Black Wind King snorted.

74
00:04:14.558 --> 00:04:17.756
"You don't impress me."

75
00:04:17.836 --> 00:04:19.717
He jabbed his lance at Wukong.

76
00:04:22.497 --> 00:04:24.858
The monkey blocked the lance with his iron bar.

77
00:04:25.878 --> 00:04:29.519
Rocks tumbled and rolled downhill as the two warriors fought.

78
00:04:31.480 --> 00:04:35.381
After an hour of fighting, the Black Wind King held up a hand.

79
00:04:36.982 --> 00:04:38.382
need to take a break.

80
00:04:39.122 --> 00:04:40.343
It's time for my lunch."

81
00:04:41.663 --> 00:04:43.444
Wukong's jaw fell open.

82
00:04:43.464 --> 00:04:50.013
"What?" Before Wukong could say anything else, the bear ran back into his cave.

83
00:04:51.578 --> 00:04:53.183
The door slammed shut.
